            "_column_size": 100
          },
          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "5b1caa5a",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p style=\"text-align:right;font-size:13px;color:#999;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;margin-bottom:24px;\">Last Updated: <strong>[DATE — e.g. 1 June 2026]</strong></p>\n<p>We ship all Burans Valley orders across India.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">1. Processing Time</h2>\n<p>Orders are processed within <strong>1–2 business days</strong> of payment confirmation (Mon–Sat, excluding public holidays). Dispatch notification with tracking is sent via email and WhatsApp.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">2. Delivery Timelines</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;\">\n<tr style=\"background:#1B3B2B;color:#fff;\"><th style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:left;\">Zone</th><th style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:left;\">Estimated Delivery</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">Metro cities</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">3–5 business days</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#F2F5F2;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">Tier 2 &amp; Tier 3 cities</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">5–7 business days</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">Remote / hill stations</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">7–10 business days</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#888;margin-top:8px;\">Estimates only. Delays may occur due to weather, festive season, or logistics disruptions.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;margin-top:36px;\">3. Shipping Charges</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;\">\n<tr style=\"background:#1B3B2B;color:#fff;\"><th style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:left;\">Order Value</th><th style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:left;\">Shipping</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">Above ₹[FREE SHIPPING THRESHOLD]</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\"><strong style=\"color:#1B3B2B;\">FREE</strong></td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#F2F5F2;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">Below ₹[FREE SHIPPING THRESHOLD]</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">₹[SHIPPING CHARGE]</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;margin-top:36px;\">4. Courier Partners</h2>\n<p>We ship via <strong>[COURIER — e.g. Delhivery / Shiprocket]</strong>. Courier selected by pin code. We may change partners without notice.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">5. Order Tracking</h2>\n<p>Tracking link sent to your email and WhatsApp after dispatch. Use the AWB number at the courier's website.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">6. Failed Delivery</h2>\n<ul><li>Delivery is attempted <strong>twice</strong>. After two failed attempts the package returns to us (RTO). Re-dispatch may incur a fee.</li><li>Ensure your address, phone, and pin code are correct. We are not liable for non-delivery due to incorrect details.</li></ul>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">7. Damaged in Transit</h2>\n<p>Contact us within 48 hours with photos. See our <a href=\"/return-refund-policy\" style=\"color:#1B3B2B;font-weight:500;\">Return &amp; Refund Policy</a>.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">8. Questions?</h2>\n<p>Email <strong>[EMAIL]</strong> or WhatsApp <strong>[WHATSAPP]</strong>.</p>\n",
